# Personal financial data — never commit real income/spending/savings numbers.
# Anchored to the repo root (where the real tracker lives), not unanchored,
# so a future legitimate fixture (e.g. tests/fixtures/*.csv) doesn't
# silently vanish from git status too.
/*.xlsx
/*.xls
/*.csv
